{"about_the_game":"He had one rule: No killing women or children. When a hitman is double-crossed by his employer, he brings forth a night of carnage and bloodshed.<br>RED HOT VENGEANCE is a twin-stick shooter with a dark and violent storyline.<br><br><strong>Main features:</strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>10 level campaign with varying objectives<br></li><li>30 challenge levels<br></li><li>New Game+<br></li><li>A variety of weapons to customize your loadout<br></li><li>Level editor with Steam Workshop support.<br></li><li>It's free :)</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058640/extras/2584ba5741185e9b06536bbb246443ca.avif?t=1572210555\" width=300 height=75 /></span><br>In the aftermath of blood, smoke, and fire, a mob hitman is reborn as the spirit of pure bloodlust fueled vengeance. There is no time for mercy as you shoot your way through 10 levels of darkness and depravity. Each chapter is connected to the last through hand-drawn, fully voice-acted cutscenes. As you play through the campaign, you will unlock a variety of weapons each with their own behavior to fit your playstyle. Earn medals for completing challenges, find secrets, and wreak vengeance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058640/extras/3b77dc8e1f1dc30134797b197b669ce8.avif?t=1572210555\" width=325 height=75 /></span><br>RED HOT VENGEANCE features 30 challenge missions. Each challenge is designed to offer a different experience from the campaign, with more experimental level design and objectives. Try to kill all the enemies with only a baseball bat, or survive an onslaught of police until the time runs out. Play the first couple of levels of the campaign to unlock challenges.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058640/extras/37d3b4a3d87c53bdec02d28b7732db7c.avif?t=1572210555\" width=325 height=75 /></span><br>RED HOT VENGEANCE features a user-friendly map editor built into the game. Utilizing Steam Workshop, you can create levels and upload them for everyone to play. While the editor doesn't place any arbitrary restrictions on the user, there are guidelines to making a good, functional level. See the guides section of the community hub for a comprehensive guide on making levels.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"2ba4d76a8693288305a4d43515029affb4648f9e.jpg","localized_name":"Hitman","name":"Hitman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1058640/2ba4d76a8693288305a4d43515029affb4648f9e.jpg"},{"icon":"19e49a99159b394c16e0140f55db7fd772c767e8.jpg","localized_name":"Boss","name":"Boss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1058640/19e49a99159b394c16e0140f55db7fd772c767e8.jpg"},{"icon":"4b00a8c8848f3948e6491c09a6717bc407087001.jpg","localized_name":"Centuries of Damn","name":"Centuries of Damn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1058640/4b00a8c8848f3948e6491c09a6717bc407087001.jpg"},{"icon":"fa4d7a71b48bd8fca26ca6e3e11eca2623ebd465.jpg","localized_name":"Man of the Millennium","name":"Man of the Millennium","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1058640/fa4d7a71b48bd8fca26ca6e3e11eca2623ebd465.jpg"},{"icon":"6ab1fae357cb7c5b6b5deb6d7f966f8ff4a13040.jpg","localized_name":"It's a secret to everyone...","name":"It's a secret to everyone...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1058640/6ab1fae357cb7c5b6b5deb6d7f966f8ff4a13040.jpg"},{"icon":"046179688b6bddf54eab1c5b897ad442d6cad660.jpg","localized_name":"Red Hot Vengeance","name":"Red Hot Vengeance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1058640/046179688b6bddf54eab1c5b897ad442d6cad660.jpg"},{"icon":"639